Also check `STOP_TAG.read` — grep showed only `has` in watch_for_stop (already proseOnly) and STOP_TAG in request_stop writes. And `request_stop.ts` reads STOP_TAG? watch_for_stop.ts:82 is the reader. Fine.

Also, `domain/work/*` — do any domain files read tags from bodies? The domain folds via readers passed in; `dispatch-chain.ts` takes predicates. The predicates are composed in adapters/machinery — I'm changing those compositions. domain/work/dispatch-chain.test.ts:40,48 pass their own predicates — tests, fine.

